      "en_US": [
        "Eusine: Did you see it?\r",
        "SUICUNE raced by like a blur, right in\n",
        "front of my eyes!\r",
        "I have been chasing SUICUNE for almost\n",
        "ten years, but I have never been this\f",
        "close! I’m all choked up!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0061_D18R0102_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way...\n",
        "It was clear to me that SUICUNE took\f",
        "notice of your presence.\r",
        "Ecruteak’s legendary Pokémon are said\n",
        "to come to people only when they\f",
        "recognize their talents.\r",
        "Perhaps I should be more aggressive\n",
        "toward SUICUNE...\r",
        "Anyway, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, we will\n",
        "meet again!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
